  m_text: 'This is just a start, I have many plans to add to the game Veverka, here
    are some of them:


    Abilities to  Veverka:  jump, rope, throw nut, see hidden
    roads


    Tile Types: slippery road, burning road, trap, hidden road, teleports,
    rotating


    Nut Types: fire, bullet, iron, magic, mimic, ice


    Other:
    Player profiles,  level making - create your own levels, share with others and
    fight!'
